# Status line template (CLI / editor integrations)

Optional single-line **context** for terminals that render a footer (see your statusline integration docs).

Suggested fields (machine-local values must stay out of git):

- `branch` — current git branch
- `dir` — basename of working directory
- `dirty` — working tree state when relevant

Example (plain text, no secrets):

`main ~/my-project-claude-tamplate clean`

Replace this file's contents with the format expected by your tooling.
